('North Trust Banking Platform','north-trust-banking-platform','FinTech & Web Applications','North Trust','Financial Services','Custom Banking Platform','12 weeks','Design and development of a modern banking-focused web platform with customer-facing pages and structured digital banking workflows.','Present financial services clearly, create a trustworthy user experience, and provide a scalable foundation for future banking functionality.','A professional banking platform concept focused on trust, clarity, responsive design and scalable web architecture.','Financial services websites need to communicate trust while presenting complex products and workflows in a simple way.','We focused on clear information architecture, responsive interfaces, strong visual hierarchy and a modular PHP/MySQL foundation.','A responsive banking platform interface with structured sections for services, account journeys, customer actions and future integrations.','Responsive banking interface\nService and product presentation\nCustomer journey sections\nStructured authentication-ready architecture\nMySQL-backed content foundation','Created a stronger digital foundation for presenting banking services and future platform functionality.','PHP, MySQL, Bootstrap, JavaScript','',NULL,'','','North Trust Banking Platform | Distinguished Web Services','A modern banking-focused web platform built with PHP, MySQL, Bootstrap and responsive UX principles.',1,1),
('LinuxCleans Booking Platform','linuxcleans-booking-platform','Booking & Service Platforms','LinuxCleans','Home Services','Booking Web Application','10 weeks','Customer-facing booking experience and backend service architecture for a cleaning-services marketplace.','Make booking a cleaning service easier while providing an architecture that supports payments, notifications and service operations.','A responsive cleaning-services booking platform designed to connect customers with professional cleaning services.','Booking platforms must reduce friction between discovering a service, selecting options, submitting details and completing a booking.','We structured the experience around a simple customer journey and prepared the application for authentication, payments, notifications and operational management.','A responsive booking platform with service discovery, booking workflows and backend integration points for payments and communications.','Service listings\nBooking workflow\nResponsive customer interface\nAuthentication-ready architecture\nPayment integration readiness\nNotification integration readiness','Established a scalable foundation for a service-booking business and future operational automation.','React, Bootstrap, Node.js, Express, MySQL, JWT, Stripe, Twilio','',NULL,'','','LinuxCleans Booking Platform | Distinguished Web Services','A responsive booking platform for a cleaning-services business with a scalable web application architecture.',1,1),
('TalentFlow AI Recruitment CRM','talentflow-ai-recruitment-crm','AI & Business Applications','TalentFlow AI','Recruitment & HR','Recruitment CRM / SaaS','14 weeks','Recruitment workflow covering jobs, candidate profiles, resumes and applications with an AI-assisted product architecture.','Centralize recruitment workflows, improve candidate organization and create a foundation for AI-assisted recruitment operations.','An AI-focused recruitment CRM concept for managing jobs, candidates, resumes and applications from one platform.','Recruitment teams often work across disconnected spreadsheets, documents and communication channels, making candidate tracking difficult.','We designed the product around feature-based modular architecture, structured data models and an extensible AI integration layer.','A modern recruitment CRM architecture connecting job management, candidate profiles, resumes and applications with AI-ready workflows.','Job management\nCandidate profiles\nResume records\nApplication tracking\nAI-assisted workflow foundation\nDashboard analytics','Created a structured foundation for a recruitment SaaS product that can evolve with additional AI and workflow automation features.','Next.js, TypeScript, Drizzle ORM, PostgreSQL, Auth.js, Tailwind CSS, OpenAI, Resend, Recharts','',NULL,'','','TalentFlow AI Recruitment CRM | Distinguished Web Services','An AI-ready recruitment CRM architecture for managing jobs, candidates, resumes and applications.',1,1),
('SMM Marketing Operations Platform','smm-marketing-operations-platform','Digital Marketing & Automation','Marketing Operations Platform','Digital Marketing','SMM Panel & Operations System','12 weeks','Development of an SMM platform with order management, provider integration, synchronization and operations/reconciliation workflows.','Automate social-media service ordering while improving operational visibility and provider synchronization.','A social-media marketing operations platform designed around automated ordering and service fulfillment workflows.','SMM operations can become difficult to manage when orders, providers, statuses and fulfillment updates are handled manually.','We focused on structured order lifecycles, provider synchronization, scheduled processing and an operations/reconciliation layer.','A database-backed marketing operations platform with service catalog, order workflows, provider synchronization and administrative controls.','Service catalog\nOrder management\nProvider API integration\nScheduled order synchronization\nOperations dashboard\nReconciliation workflows','Improved the architecture for managing high-volume marketing service operations and reducing manual reconciliation work.','PHP, MySQL, Bootstrap, JavaScript, REST APIs, Scheduled Tasks','',NULL,'','','SMM Marketing Operations Platform | Distinguished Web Services','A marketing operations platform built around order management, provider synchronization and reconciliation workflows.',1,1),
('Music Distribution Platform','music-distribution-platform','Music Technology','Independent Music Platform','Music & Entertainment','Digital Distribution Platform','12 weeks','Platform architecture for music distribution workflows including authenticated APIs, database-backed records and future distributor integrations.','Create a scalable technical foundation for artists and administrators to manage music distribution workflows.','A music distribution platform concept built to organize releases, authenticated API workflows and distribution operations.','Music distribution involves multiple entities including artists, releases, tracks, metadata and external distribution services.','We designed the system around authenticated APIs, persistent database records and modular integration points.','A backend-first distribution architecture prepared for release management, artist workflows and external distributor integrations.','Authenticated API\nArtist and release records\nDatabase-backed workflows\nDistribution integration layer\nAdmin operations foundation','Established a modular technical foundation for expanding into a full music distribution service.','PHP, MySQL, REST APIs, Authentication, Bootstrap, JavaScript','',NULL,'','','Music Distribution Platform | Distinguished Web Services','A scalable music distribution platform architecture for release management and distributor integrations.',1,1),
